<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cineplex Odeon cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cineplex Odeon cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said analyst Gary Farber downgraded Cineplex Odeon Corp to hold from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- A NatWest report said the company's fourth-quarter results came in &quot;well below&quot; NatWest's expectations.</p>
<p>-- Also cited company's &quot;significant leverage position.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 1-3/8.</p>
</text>
